type: software
title: "disscube-grids: building gridded variables from open data with DisSCube"
abstract: "Study-area examples (pipeline files, run scripts, run records and maps) that build gridded variables on the Brazil Data Cube Albers mesh, from MapBiomas, PRODES and Brazil Data Cube sources with DisSCube."
